WEBVTT

00:00:02.274 --> 00:00:03.974
Heave to!

00:00:03.974 --> 00:00:06.204
I say again, heave to!

00:00:06.584 --> 00:00:09.584
Shut up! After buying all this stuff,

00:00:09.584 --> 00:00:11.914
I'd rather use it than hand it over without a fight!

00:00:16.554 --> 00:00:18.754
Come and get us!

00:00:22.364 --> 00:00:24.524
Please stop this useless resistance.

00:00:24.934 --> 00:00:28.064
I'm arresting you for the
crime of arms smuggling!

00:00:28.434 --> 00:00:30.234
A high school girl?

00:00:30.234 --> 00:00:32.724
Idiot! She's a special esper!

00:00:36.314 --> 00:00:38.444
Code name: Wild Cat!

00:00:38.444 --> 00:00:40.484
I will carry out my duty!

00:00:40.484 --> 00:00:42.314
Dammit, take her out!

00:00:43.314 --> 00:00:47.544
PSYCHIC STUN SUBJECTION!

00:00:53.764 --> 00:00:55.524
Mission, accomplished!

00:00:55.524 --> 00:00:57.694
All right! Well done, Naomi!

00:00:57.694 --> 00:01:00.364
Now come back, my Naomi!

00:01:00.364 --> 00:01:03.264
Come on, my fair lady!

00:01:07.774 --> 00:01:09.864
What's wrong, Naomi?

00:01:13.314 --> 00:01:14.074
Ow!

00:01:14.214 --> 00:01:15.114
Come on!

00:01:16.614 --> 00:01:19.184
There's none of her usual hotblooded
contact with me today.

00:01:19.184 --> 00:01:21.714
Naomi! Come back!

00:01:22.284 --> 00:01:25.194
It's pretty awesome, invincible power!

00:01:25.594 --> 00:01:28.464
Boy, does it feel great

00:01:28.824 --> 00:01:31.594
Absolutely lovely! So we never lose!

00:01:32.034 --> 00:01:35.194
Come on, let's head for tomorrow!

00:01:37.104 --> 00:01:38.234
Zettai Karen Children

00:01:38.234 --> 00:01:39.404
Zettai Karen Children
Yeah!

00:01:39.404 --> 00:01:40.674
Zettai Karen Children
Absolutely!

00:01:40.674 --> 00:01:42.344
Zettai Karen Children

00:01:42.344 --> 00:01:43.364
Zettai Karen Children
Daring!

00:01:43.544 --> 00:01:46.844
It just takes a touch for me to know

00:01:46.844 --> 00:01:49.284
The limiter on my heart

00:01:50.014 --> 00:01:52.714
Has been released, and then you see

00:01:53.124 --> 00:01:56.314
Yes! Change the world!

00:01:56.554 --> 00:01:59.424
Trying again and again through hot battle!

00:01:59.724 --> 00:02:03.034
Reaching through what's real

00:02:03.034 --> 00:02:06.264
Absolutely lovely! So we never lose!

00:02:06.264 --> 00:02:09.204
The thrills just can't be beat!

00:02:10.334 --> 00:02:16.814
Courage begins to light the
darkness of the world

00:02:16.814 --> 00:02:22.754
It overflows with the miracles you gave

00:02:23.184 --> 00:02:27.584
If you can take pride in a smile

00:02:27.584 --> 00:02:29.574
That suits no one else

00:02:29.794 --> 00:02:34.324
Then let's go beyond the future now

00:02:34.324 --> 00:02:38.424
We can try over the future world!

00:02:38.664 --> 00:02:39.034
Yeah!

00:02:39.764 --> 00:02:40.424
Ultimate!

00:02:42.574 --> 00:02:43.794
Daring!

00:02:55.344 --> 00:02:57.374
19th sense.
"Runaway Angel! It Can't Be My Naomi!"

00:02:59.484 --> 00:03:02.544
Naomi. Oh, my Naomi...

00:03:03.054 --> 00:03:05.354
Mr. Minamoto! Here, have a drink!

00:03:05.454 --> 00:03:07.394
Oh, thanks.

00:03:07.394 --> 00:03:08.864
No prob.

00:03:08.864 --> 00:03:13.194
So, what was this important matter,
Supervisor Tanizaki?

00:03:13.764 --> 00:03:16.374
Hey, hold it! What is this?!

00:03:16.374 --> 00:03:18.804
What's with this shower scene?

00:03:18.804 --> 00:03:21.904
Because I won't have to worry about
Naomi overhearing me in here.

00:03:22.074 --> 00:03:24.514
Is it something she shouldn't hear?

00:03:25.114 --> 00:03:27.614
The thing I've asked you here to discuss...

00:03:27.614 --> 00:03:30.184
does concern my precious Naomi.

00:03:30.184 --> 00:03:32.184
I noticed it yesterday.

00:03:32.184 --> 00:03:34.854
Naomi's attitude towards me has grown cold.

00:03:34.854 --> 00:03:37.484
I'm starting to think things
aren't going well between us.

00:03:38.624 --> 00:03:41.294
You only realized that just now?

00:03:41.294 --> 00:03:44.664
Never mind that! What viewers
want in these scenes are...

00:03:44.664 --> 00:03:46.134
Look at this.

00:03:48.704 --> 00:03:52.464
This is my personal Naomi Growth
file collection.

00:03:53.144 --> 00:03:54.074
Ew!

00:03:54.074 --> 00:03:56.174
You take candid shots of an esper
under your supervision?

00:03:56.174 --> 00:03:57.514
Should you be showing us this?!

00:03:57.514 --> 00:04:01.884
When I think something's troubling her,
I always scrupulously track her.

00:04:09.254 --> 00:04:13.394
Shouldn't we fire special esper
supervisors like this guy?

00:04:13.394 --> 00:04:16.764
Now, look at this photo I got a short time ago.

00:04:17.364 --> 00:04:19.734
And now this.

00:04:20.064 --> 00:04:21.694
Th-This is!

00:04:22.234 --> 00:04:23.234
Blackmail?!

00:04:23.234 --> 00:04:24.274
Shoplifting?!

00:04:24.274 --> 00:04:25.904
Naomi did that?!

00:04:25.904 --> 00:04:27.234
The decisive moment.

00:04:27.674 --> 00:04:30.344
It can't be true! There must be some mistake!

00:04:30.344 --> 00:04:31.914
That's right! Naomi wouldn't!

00:04:31.914 --> 00:04:33.644
We can't believe it!

00:04:33.644 --> 00:04:35.274
Girls' friendship!

00:04:35.584 --> 00:04:39.114
You! What are you doing?!
How long have you been in here?!

00:04:40.054 --> 00:04:43.154
Oh, come on. This isn't the first time.

00:04:43.154 --> 00:04:44.524
That's not what I mean!

00:04:44.524 --> 00:04:46.894
There's no problem. I'm fine with it.

00:04:46.894 --> 00:04:48.154
No, it's just...

00:04:49.194 --> 00:04:53.424
Don't take pictures! This is the
men's area! GET OUT!

00:04:55.134 --> 00:04:58.104
This one time, I'm asking for your help!

00:04:58.104 --> 00:05:00.864
If you want my body, take as many
pictures as you like!

00:05:02.074 --> 00:05:03.134
Pervert!

00:05:03.474 --> 00:05:05.604
Don't be shy! Look!

00:05:09.184 --> 00:05:11.674
What is this?! Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:05:14.284 --> 00:05:16.314
Hatsune! Cut it out!

00:05:17.254 --> 00:05:18.584
Good girl.

00:05:21.124 --> 00:05:24.164
So, what do you want us to do?

00:05:24.164 --> 00:05:27.734
Naomi may be turning to a life of crime.

00:05:27.734 --> 00:05:28.864
Life of crime?

00:05:28.864 --> 00:05:32.804
I want your help in rehabilitating Naomi.

00:05:32.804 --> 00:05:36.844
I want you to observe her so that she
doesn't make any more mistakes!

00:05:36.844 --> 00:05:40.414
I'll look for the boy in the picture
and ask him what's really going on.

00:05:40.414 --> 00:05:43.014
Please! I beg of you!

00:05:43.014 --> 00:05:48.254
Minamoto. Considering what
he's said, why not help him?

00:05:48.254 --> 00:05:53.264
Mr. Tanizaki's definitely
worried about Naomi.

00:05:53.264 --> 00:05:55.254
And we're worried about her, too.

00:05:56.334 --> 00:05:57.864
I understand.

00:05:57.864 --> 00:06:00.124
Seems like we did this once before.

00:06:03.534 --> 00:06:06.244
And so we return to Kuretake Ryou,
BABEL's women's dorm!

00:06:06.244 --> 00:06:08.504
Man, my blood is boiling!

00:06:08.504 --> 00:06:10.844
You said the same thing, last time.

00:06:10.844 --> 00:06:13.444
Shouldn't you all be in school?

00:06:13.444 --> 00:06:15.514
This is no time for school!

00:06:15.514 --> 00:06:19.584
Right. A special esper caught shoplifting
would be a major scandal.

00:06:19.584 --> 00:06:24.194
If it's true, the Normal People or some
other anti-esper group would just love it!

00:06:24.194 --> 00:06:26.784
This is a problem for all of us espers.

00:06:27.124 --> 00:06:29.964
Jeez, all they're really good at is double-talk.

00:06:37.804 --> 00:06:39.064
CUTE!

00:06:39.804 --> 00:06:42.814
Since security's too tight to
get into the women's dorm,

00:06:42.814 --> 00:06:45.074
I figured we'd use Akira's power.

00:06:45.474 --> 00:06:48.074
Right, Supervisor Minamoto! I'll do my best!

00:06:49.814 --> 00:06:52.184
What are you doing to my Minamoto?!

00:06:52.184 --> 00:06:53.084
Hand!

00:06:53.084 --> 00:06:54.324
Yes, Boss!

00:06:54.324 --> 00:06:56.414
That's a good girl.

00:06:57.054 --> 00:06:59.724
Well, Akira, if you would?

00:06:59.724 --> 00:07:01.694
Right, leave it to me!

00:07:01.694 --> 00:07:02.954
Replace!

00:07:04.794 --> 00:07:06.594
REPLACE, COMPLETE!!

00:07:07.104 --> 00:07:09.894
All right, begin observation of Naomi!

00:07:10.234 --> 00:07:11.224
Yeah!

00:07:20.284 --> 00:07:21.944
This way?

00:07:21.944 --> 00:07:24.344
He should be able to enter
through the gaps in the vent.

00:07:27.424 --> 00:07:28.254
What's that?

00:07:34.364 --> 00:07:35.464
It's Hotaru.

00:07:35.464 --> 00:07:36.664
Her morning shampoo.

00:07:36.664 --> 00:07:39.024
Ooh, a good sign first thing in the day!

00:07:40.604 --> 00:07:41.624
Hey.

00:07:43.434 --> 00:07:44.804
Uh-oh! She's spotted him!

00:07:44.804 --> 00:07:45.774
Move, fast!

00:07:46.474 --> 00:07:47.444
Right!

00:07:48.474 --> 00:07:52.934
I thought I sensed someone leering at
me, but... Must be my imagination.

00:07:53.384 --> 00:07:55.884
Whew! That was too close!

00:07:55.884 --> 00:07:58.084
What you'd expect of a Level 5 telepath.

00:07:58.084 --> 00:07:59.984
Would you girls be serious?

00:08:05.354 --> 00:08:07.384
This must be Naomi's room.

00:08:08.824 --> 00:08:10.194
Akira says he's going into the room.

00:08:11.834 --> 00:08:13.504
You can't tell who it is.

00:08:13.504 --> 00:08:15.604
Look under the sheets!

00:08:15.604 --> 00:08:17.274
Hey! Kaoru!

00:08:17.274 --> 00:08:19.704
We're just seeing whose room this is!

00:08:19.704 --> 00:08:20.844
Can't really see much.

00:08:20.844 --> 00:08:22.644
Not enough light.

00:08:22.644 --> 00:08:25.334
No, this should do it!

00:08:26.344 --> 00:08:28.284
What's wrong, Akira?

00:08:28.914 --> 00:08:31.244
He says it's squishing him,
but it's really soft, too.

00:08:32.414 --> 00:08:33.524
It's Natsuko.

00:08:33.524 --> 00:08:35.574
Oh, I wish I was a hamster!

00:08:35.854 --> 00:08:37.424
Akira, move.

00:08:37.424 --> 00:08:39.584
Too flexible... Can't move!

00:08:44.094 --> 00:08:45.464
Huh? Naomi!

00:08:49.904 --> 00:08:51.634
Akira, get back here.

00:08:51.634 --> 00:08:52.364
Right...

00:09:01.284 --> 00:09:03.084
Nothing seems to have changed much.

00:09:03.084 --> 00:09:05.184
The usual Miss Honor Student.

00:09:05.184 --> 00:09:07.454
No! She must have a hidden face!

00:09:07.454 --> 00:09:08.974
Girls are scary.

00:09:19.564 --> 00:09:23.404
Great! Seeing young girls sweat is so awesome!

00:09:27.944 --> 00:09:32.244
Sleeves, okay! Apron, set and ready!

00:09:32.244 --> 00:09:34.214
Good luck, Naomi!

00:09:34.214 --> 00:09:35.684
Here goes!

00:09:38.614 --> 00:09:40.954
I'm never eating curry udon again!

00:09:42.724 --> 00:09:45.294
She said the exact same thing last time!

00:09:45.294 --> 00:09:46.854
The creepy old guy killer is still going strong.

00:09:47.094 --> 00:09:49.264
Natural airhead, as usual.

00:09:49.264 --> 00:09:49.924
Moe...

00:09:50.694 --> 00:09:52.364
I'll see you tomorrow.

00:09:52.364 --> 00:09:54.134
What's got you in such a hurry?

00:09:54.134 --> 00:09:56.294
Just a little errand I have to run.

00:10:03.774 --> 00:10:05.764
SORRY, I LOST HER...

00:10:05.844 --> 00:10:07.974
It's suspicious! Something's definitely up!

00:10:09.584 --> 00:10:11.714
I've learned Naomi's scent!

00:10:11.714 --> 00:10:13.614
All right! Go to it, Hatsune!

00:10:13.984 --> 00:10:16.184
Hatsune, metamorphosis!

00:10:30.374 --> 00:10:31.024
Found it.

00:10:34.044 --> 00:10:37.944
Downtown... And headed for a pretty rough part.

00:10:38.314 --> 00:10:40.544
What's Naomi going there for?

00:10:46.384 --> 00:10:47.684
Here it is.

00:10:47.684 --> 00:10:51.144
Special esper, Wild Cat: released.

00:10:55.694 --> 00:10:59.754
Excuse me. This is where the biker
gang "Red" hangs out, right?

00:11:00.864 --> 00:11:03.174
What do you want with us?

00:11:03.174 --> 00:11:06.134
Maybe you came so we'd show you a good time.

00:11:06.134 --> 00:11:08.204
Naomi's scent is here.

00:11:08.204 --> 00:11:10.364
Okay, leave the rest to me.

00:11:12.274 --> 00:11:15.814
Excuse me, I'm sorry to bother you, but, well...

00:11:15.814 --> 00:11:18.374
You're a pretty little thing, ain't you?

00:11:20.384 --> 00:11:22.044
Don't touch me!

00:11:23.924 --> 00:11:26.124
Don't touch me with your disgusting hands!

00:11:26.124 --> 00:11:28.894
I have enough stressing me out as it is!

00:11:28.894 --> 00:11:30.894
And the moment we've been waiting for arrives!

00:11:30.894 --> 00:11:32.194
The hidden face appears!

00:11:32.194 --> 00:11:33.664
Just like I thought!

00:11:34.664 --> 00:11:36.824
I thought you all believed in her.

00:11:40.574 --> 00:11:42.664
Both of them are the "real" me.

00:11:45.214 --> 00:11:47.684
Oh, well. Let's "do it."

00:11:53.024 --> 00:11:56.284
Not him. Not him, either.

00:12:00.824 --> 00:12:03.194
This... This girl...

00:12:03.194 --> 00:12:04.354
She's an esper!

00:12:05.264 --> 00:12:09.264
Sorry! I've had this creepy old guy
clinging to me for the last few days,

00:12:09.264 --> 00:12:11.794
and I've been so angry that I
just acted without thinking.

00:12:12.234 --> 00:12:13.834
Screw with me, huh? Hey!

00:12:21.784 --> 00:12:24.344
She's a different level than
the espers we're used to!

00:12:24.784 --> 00:12:27.544
Um, I just came to talk.

00:12:31.254 --> 00:12:33.354
Let's just be calm and talk.

00:12:37.834 --> 00:12:40.824
You be quiet and I'll be quiet, okay?

00:12:48.344 --> 00:12:50.274
Please?

00:12:50.274 --> 00:12:52.714
Isn't she scared of us?

00:12:52.714 --> 00:12:56.014
There's something scary about her,
and it's not just her powers!

00:12:56.014 --> 00:12:58.484
Uh-oh. Stop her! Get ready!

00:13:00.454 --> 00:13:02.924
It was just getting really interesting!

00:13:02.924 --> 00:13:03.994
Exciting!

00:13:03.994 --> 00:13:05.824
This is no time to be watching for fun!

00:13:05.824 --> 00:13:07.364
Wait.

00:13:07.364 --> 00:13:10.394
One wrong move, and you'll have The Children

00:13:10.394 --> 00:13:12.994
doing urban ESP combat with Wild Cat.

00:13:18.974 --> 00:13:23.034
That'll just give the anti-esper
groups even more of an excuse.

00:13:23.544 --> 00:13:26.244
It wouldn't turn into urban combat.

00:13:26.244 --> 00:13:29.514
No. Girls are frightening when they're angry.

00:13:31.854 --> 00:13:33.974
Look. Naomi's doing something.

00:13:34.924 --> 00:13:36.384
Middle school kid?

00:13:36.384 --> 00:13:39.494
Yes. Someone here is threatening
a middle school boy

00:13:39.494 --> 00:13:41.254
and extorting money from him.

00:13:41.824 --> 00:13:52.004
When I talked to him, he said he was selling it
to get the money to pay you guys off.

00:13:52.004 --> 00:13:54.594
I snuck the stolen merchandise
back into the store.

00:13:56.044 --> 00:13:57.674
So, that's what it was.

00:13:57.674 --> 00:14:01.314
I knew I could trust Naomi!

00:14:01.314 --> 00:14:02.244
Me, too!

00:14:02.244 --> 00:14:03.584
And me!

00:14:05.914 --> 00:14:07.084
So, you see, I'd like you to promise
not to do something like that again.

00:14:07.084 --> 00:14:10.524
FURIOUS!
So, you see, I'd like you to promise
not to do something like that again.

00:14:10.524 --> 00:14:10.994
So, you see, I'd like you to promise
not to do something like that again.

00:14:10.994 --> 00:14:12.194
Hold it!

00:14:12.194 --> 00:14:13.124
Yes?

00:14:13.124 --> 00:14:16.524
How do you know what he told you was true?

00:14:17.064 --> 00:14:21.134
We're a hard core biker gang!
We don't shake down kids!

00:14:21.134 --> 00:14:26.264
Maybe he fed you that story
to make us Reds look bad!

00:14:34.084 --> 00:14:37.444
Hey, what are you? Don't cry.

00:14:38.284 --> 00:14:41.374
I just swallowed the story he told me.

00:14:41.984 --> 00:14:44.144
Now that you mention it,
he didn't give me any proof!

00:14:45.024 --> 00:14:46.894
I'm so sorry!

00:14:49.464 --> 00:14:50.994
This girl is a pain!

00:14:50.994 --> 00:14:51.394
WHOA...
This girl is a pain!

00:14:51.394 --> 00:14:52.124
WHOA...

00:14:52.534 --> 00:14:56.734
I was awful to just decide
you were all bad guys!

00:14:57.434 --> 00:15:01.174
Well, it's easy for people to misjudge us.

00:15:01.174 --> 00:15:04.374
And we settled this quietly, right?

00:15:05.074 --> 00:15:07.804
Here, just drink this juice and calm down, okay?

00:15:14.954 --> 00:15:16.474
It's really good.

00:15:19.294 --> 00:15:22.384
You're all really nice guys, aren't you?

00:15:25.594 --> 00:15:28.534
I'm really sorry to have doubted you.

00:15:28.534 --> 00:15:32.334
Nice people like you could
never do something like that.

00:15:32.334 --> 00:15:34.964
Well, your understanding is enough.

00:15:35.404 --> 00:15:37.244
W-Would you like some more?

00:15:37.244 --> 00:15:38.974
Yes, please.

00:15:38.974 --> 00:15:40.684
Hey! Bring her a refill!

00:15:40.684 --> 00:15:42.444
And bring out some cake, too!

00:15:42.444 --> 00:15:44.854
I've got some nice sweet potato pudding here!

00:15:44.854 --> 00:15:46.374
I've got sweet bean paste!

00:15:46.824 --> 00:15:49.344
Give her something classier, you dumb ass!

00:15:51.024 --> 00:15:52.624
What is this?

00:15:52.624 --> 00:15:54.194
This is amazing...

00:15:54.194 --> 00:15:55.464
Well, I've lost interest.

00:15:55.464 --> 00:15:57.264
Leave it to Naomi.

00:15:57.264 --> 00:15:59.324
I'm glad she settled it without a major incident.

00:16:17.454 --> 00:16:19.504
You're all under arrest!

00:16:20.124 --> 00:16:23.524
You scum have no right to live!

00:16:23.524 --> 00:16:25.424
Now what?!

00:16:25.694 --> 00:16:28.364
You lot of rotten tangerines!

00:16:28.364 --> 00:16:30.934
You flies swarming over sweet honey!

00:16:30.934 --> 00:16:32.164
Supervisor Tanizaki!

00:16:32.164 --> 00:16:36.224
You people have been shaking down
a kid or two, haven't you?!

00:16:39.134 --> 00:16:41.944
This boy told me everything, Naomi!

00:16:41.944 --> 00:16:45.114
But leave it to my dear Naomi!

00:16:45.114 --> 00:16:48.214
Going in alone to clean up society's filth!

00:16:48.214 --> 00:16:49.844
But don't waste your time with this garbage...

00:16:49.844 --> 00:16:51.444
The only garbage here...

00:16:51.954 --> 00:16:54.184
There it is!
is you!

00:16:54.484 --> 00:16:57.714
I've been waiting for this burning contact!

00:16:58.194 --> 00:17:02.524
I just got through being forgiven by
them for being so thoughtless!

00:17:02.524 --> 00:17:04.864
Where do you get off, coming in
and saying that stuff to them?!

00:17:05.734 --> 00:17:09.974
But, you don't know how to
be suspicious of others!

00:17:09.974 --> 00:17:12.904
Because I never taught you to do that!

00:17:13.404 --> 00:17:17.774
Is it wrong to be trusting?
Is it wrong to believe people?!

00:17:19.444 --> 00:17:21.814
You may be the worst supervisor ever,

00:17:21.814 --> 00:17:25.854
but one thing I'm grateful for is that
you raised me to be this way!

00:17:25.854 --> 00:17:28.024
N-Naomi...

00:17:28.024 --> 00:17:29.244
Excuse me.

00:17:30.524 --> 00:17:31.894
The boy from yesterday.

00:17:31.894 --> 00:17:33.224
That's the guy who shook me down.

00:17:35.964 --> 00:17:37.694
You mean, you?!

00:17:39.094 --> 00:17:40.294
No...

00:17:40.464 --> 00:17:42.204
See? As I thought!

00:17:42.204 --> 00:17:44.434
Right! After him, Naomi!

00:17:44.934 --> 00:17:45.604
Naomi!

00:17:45.604 --> 00:17:47.004
Yes, sir!

00:17:47.674 --> 00:17:49.604
Okay, we're pursuing him, too!

00:17:51.514 --> 00:17:53.844
Criminal ran this way!

00:17:57.454 --> 00:17:59.254
She's in shock, huh?

00:17:59.254 --> 00:18:01.924
Because she had her trust betrayed.

00:18:01.924 --> 00:18:03.544
It must have hurt her.

00:18:09.294 --> 00:18:10.764
Wait!

00:18:10.764 --> 00:18:13.254
What are you doing here? Why did you come?!

00:18:13.664 --> 00:18:16.154
Naomi! Listen to us!

00:18:17.574 --> 00:18:19.864
I swear, we didn't know!

00:18:20.044 --> 00:18:22.874
We'll never do anything disgraceful
like this again! Forgive us!

00:18:22.874 --> 00:18:25.444
We won't hurt anyone again!

00:18:25.444 --> 00:18:27.144
We won't bother anybody!

00:18:28.714 --> 00:18:29.884
Guys...

00:18:29.884 --> 00:18:33.384
That guy made Naomi and us both look bad!

00:18:33.384 --> 00:18:36.484
We'll take him to the cops and
make him pay for his crime!

00:18:36.484 --> 00:18:39.254
We never meant to lie or trick you!

00:18:39.254 --> 00:18:40.954
Believe us, please!

00:18:41.864 --> 00:18:43.324
Sure!

00:18:47.104 --> 00:18:48.724
Found him! There!

00:18:52.904 --> 00:18:57.074
Go! We'll catch him and make him pay!

00:18:57.074 --> 00:18:59.844
So that Naomi's feelings for us won't be wasted!

00:18:59.844 --> 00:19:00.014
YEAH!
So that Naomi's feelings for us won't be wasted!

00:19:00.014 --> 00:19:00.474
YEAH!

00:19:03.144 --> 00:19:07.054
Why, you! How dare you soil
the name of the Reds!

00:19:08.554 --> 00:19:09.924
They're gonna catch me!

00:19:16.994 --> 00:19:17.994
Yasu!

00:19:17.994 --> 00:19:20.464
Uh-oh! The Children, released!

00:19:34.084 --> 00:19:37.444
Shoplifting is a crime! The police are
called as soon as you're caught!

00:19:37.884 --> 00:19:41.014
Extortion is a crime! And bullying is lame!

00:19:41.624 --> 00:19:44.784
Traffic violations are a crime!
Let's wear our helmets!

00:19:45.224 --> 00:19:48.454
Even if your friends tempt you,
have the courage to just say no!

00:19:49.264 --> 00:19:50.764
Stop crime!

00:19:50.764 --> 00:19:54.694
Special espers, The Children
and Wild Cat, are on the scene!

00:19:54.934 --> 00:19:56.954
Heeeeeeeeeelp!

00:19:58.074 --> 00:20:00.594
PSYCHIC FLYING CIRCUS!

00:20:04.314 --> 00:20:06.364
PSYCHIC REVIEW MEETING!

00:20:19.224 --> 00:20:21.494
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:20:21.494 --> 00:20:22.764
Yasu!

00:20:22.764 --> 00:20:23.164
Yes?

00:20:28.334 --> 00:20:31.304
Thank God... You're safe!

00:20:31.304 --> 00:20:33.174
Thank God!

00:20:33.174 --> 00:20:34.644
Leader...

00:20:36.844 --> 00:20:37.904
I'm sorry!

00:20:54.394 --> 00:20:56.064
Naomi.

00:20:56.064 --> 00:20:57.094
Yes?

00:20:57.094 --> 00:21:00.964
We're glad you believed in us. Thank you.

00:21:00.964 --> 00:21:01.864
Thank you!

00:21:02.634 --> 00:21:04.134
Guys!

00:21:04.134 --> 00:21:07.774
She managed to get even those
guys to crack a smile.

00:21:07.774 --> 00:21:09.534
The terrifying creepy old guy killer!

00:21:09.674 --> 00:21:12.004
God, guys fall for this stuff so easily!

00:21:12.744 --> 00:21:15.014
I'm just glad we settled things peacefully.

00:21:15.014 --> 00:21:15.944
Exactly.

00:21:16.014 --> 00:21:17.944
Oh, thank goodness!

00:21:18.584 --> 00:21:20.454
Naomi isn't turning into a delinquent!

00:21:21.054 --> 00:21:25.184
Her warm treatment of me has
returned! I'm so happy!

00:21:26.124 --> 00:21:29.064
I'm hungry from running so much.

00:21:30.194 --> 00:21:30.954
No!

00:21:35.734 --> 00:21:38.204
Special esper: Wild Cat, moving out!

00:21:42.274 --> 00:21:45.334
Naomi! Good luck!

00:21:50.614 --> 00:21:52.674
Wait! Wait for me, Naomi!

00:21:53.784 --> 00:21:57.384
So, the biker gang Red has reformed
as Naomi's personal guard, huh?

00:21:57.624 --> 00:21:59.324
How annoying.

00:21:59.324 --> 00:22:00.424
Go get 'em, Naomi!

00:22:00.424 --> 00:22:01.324
Be careful!

00:22:01.324 --> 00:22:02.554
See you later!

00:22:03.094 --> 00:22:05.424
Right! See you later!

00:22:10.674 --> 00:22:16.104
Because, you're my heart's desire!

00:22:16.104 --> 00:22:16.404
Yeah

00:22:33.454 --> 00:22:36.724
When it comes to you, you see

00:22:38.494 --> 00:22:44.024
My ESP is no good at all

00:22:44.334 --> 00:22:50.464
Love is a puzzle that even

00:22:50.844 --> 00:22:53.144
Pythagoras couldn't solve

00:22:55.344 --> 00:23:00.084
Don't hang your head or have a tearful face

00:23:00.524 --> 00:23:05.354
Because miracles are born from smiles

00:23:06.054 --> 00:23:07.464
My, my, my heart's desire

00:23:07.464 --> 00:23:07.764
Zoom zoom!

00:23:07.764 --> 00:23:08.764
I want to make

00:23:08.764 --> 00:23:09.224
Bye-bye!

00:23:09.224 --> 00:23:12.954
You my bold desire

00:23:13.094 --> 00:23:17.074
So absolutely serious, it gives me chills!

00:23:17.074 --> 00:23:18.504
Trans, trans, transform

00:23:18.504 --> 00:23:18.804
Zoom zoom!

00:23:18.804 --> 00:23:19.774
I'll give you

00:23:19.774 --> 00:23:20.444
Yeah yeah!

00:23:20.444 --> 00:23:25.244
A dynamite kiss!

00:23:25.374 --> 00:23:28.144
I absolutely want you to love me!

00:23:28.144 --> 00:23:38.344
Because, you're my heart's desire

00:23:39.894 --> 00:23:40.864
NEXT EPISODE

00:23:40.864 --> 00:23:42.694
NEXT EPISODE
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:43.224 --> 00:23:44.334
Seeds!

00:23:44.334 --> 00:23:47.024
How I adore sunflower seeds!

00:23:48.164 --> 00:23:50.194
Hey, isn't that Major Hyobu's...

00:23:50.264 --> 00:23:51.174
Momotaro!

00:23:51.174 --> 00:23:52.934
He looks really weak!

00:23:52.934 --> 00:23:55.334
Okay, then let's bring him
home and take care of him!

00:23:56.604 --> 00:23:57.904
Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:58.214 --> 00:24:01.984
Episode 20: "Super Beast Cartoon!
Sometimes, You Act Like an Animal..."

00:24:01.984 --> 00:24:04.674
Oh, so you all are espers?

00:24:04.914 --> 00:24:05.014
Super Beast Cartoon!
Sometimes, You Act Like an Animal...

00:24:05.014 --> 00:24:06.514
Super Beast Cartoon!
Sometimes, You Act Like an Animal...
Hyobu? Who's that?

00:24:06.514 --> 00:24:08.554
Super Beast Cartoon!
Sometimes, You Act Like an Animal...
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:08.554 --> 00:24:09.884
Super Beast Cartoon!
Sometimes, You Act Like an Animal...
